    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate rates of phenotypic and taxonomic change per unit time in early versus later fossil intervals, correcting for sampling, and compare rates with reconstructed diversity and complexity. Lower early rates would support the claim.";
